      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "10",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Daudi akwapunda pa ngondo Aamoni ni Asiliya",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 10:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pali papite ndaŵi, Nahasi mwenye jwa Aamoni ŵawile, Hanuni mwanace jwakwe ni juŵajinjile ucimwene m'malo mwakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.10.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.10.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 10:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.10.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.10.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " ni ŵatite kuti, “Tindame najo mwakulupicika Hanuni, mwanace jwa Nahasi, mpela muŵandendele babagwe une yindu yambone.” Myoyo Daudi ŵatumile ŵakutumicila ŵakwe kuti ajawule kuja kumtulasya Hanuni ligongo lya ciwa ca babagwe. Myoyo ŵakutumicila ŵa Daudiwo ŵajile kwika mcilambo ca Aamoni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.10.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.10.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 10:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.10.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.10.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 10:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nambo nduna sya mwenye jwa Aamoni ŵamwusisye Hanuni mbujegwawo kuti, “Ana akuganisya kuti Daudi piŵatumicisye ŵandu kwisa kukwatulasya, akwatendela baba ŵawo ŵalakwe ucimbicimbi? Ana ngaŵa Daudi ŵatumile ŵakutumicila ŵakweŵa kwa ŵalakwe kuti awusonde ni kuwulolecesya msindawu, kuti pitawulolecesye, ayice kuwujonanga?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.10.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.10.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 10:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Myoyo Hanuni ŵakamwile ŵakutumicila ŵa Daudi ŵala, ni ŵamyosile ndewu mbali jimope. Kaneko ŵayikatile yakuwala yawo pasikati, paciwunu, ni ŵalesile kuti ajawuleje. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.10.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 10:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi piŵayipikene yeleyi, ŵatumile ŵandu kuti akacingamile ŵandu ŵiŵatumile ŵala, ligongo lyakuti jemanjajo syakamwile soni mnope. Mwenye ŵatite kuti, “Mkasalile kuti atame kaje ku Yeliko mpaka sili simesile ndewu syawo, panyuma pakwe tayiceje akuno.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.10.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 10:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.10.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 10:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Piŵamanyilile ŵandu ŵa lukosyo lwa Aamoni kuti amtandite Daudi, ŵatumile ŵandu kuja kulembela asilikali ŵa ganyu ku cilambo ca Siliya, ku upande wa Betelehobu ni ŵa ku upande wa ku Soba ŵakwanila 20,000. Ŵamlembile soni mwenye jwa ku Maaka pamo ni asilikali ŵakwe ŵa ngondo 1,000, ni ŵandu ŵakwanila 12,000 ŵa ku Tobu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.10.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.10.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 10:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Piŵapikene Daudi yeleyo, ŵamtumile Yowabu ni likuga lyakwe lyosope lya asilikali ŵamacili ŵa ngondo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.10.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.10.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 10:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aamoni ŵakopwece ni ŵajimi pa misela ja asilikali ŵa ngondo pa mlango ŵa cipata cakwinjilila mu msinda wawo wekulungwa ŵa Laba. Nambo asilikali ŵa ganyu ŵa ku Asiliya, upande ŵa Soba ni ŵa ku Lehobu, soni ŵandu ŵa ku Tobu ni ŵa ku Maaka, ŵajimi ku malo gajika gangali yitela.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.10.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.10.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 10:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.10.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.10.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 10:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Piŵalolite Yowabu kuti asilikali ŵa ngondo ŵa amagongo ŵakwe atemi pasogolo pakwe, ŵasagwile asilikali ŵa ngondo ŵamacili pasikati pa Aisalaeli, ni ŵajimice mwakulolegana ni Asiliyawo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.10.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.10.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 10:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asilikali ŵane ŵakusigalawo ŵaŵisile m'magasa mwa Abishayi, mpwakwe, ni ŵajimice asilikaliwo mwakulolegana ni Aamoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.10.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.10.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 10:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Myoyo Yowabu ŵamsalile Abishayi kuti, “Naga Asiliya akumbunda macili, m'mwejo timungamucisye. Nambo naga Aamoni akumpunda m'mwejo macili, ni kuti une tinjiyika kukumkamucisya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.10.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 10:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mlimbe mtima, ni tutende cilumelume ligongo lya ŵandu ŵetu, soni ligongo lya misinda ja Mlungu jwetu. Tukwaŵenda AMBUJE",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.10.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.10.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " kuti kusaka kwawo kutendekwe.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.10.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.10.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 10:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yowabu ni asilikali ŵakwe ŵa ngondo, ŵasejelele ciŵandika ni asilikali ŵa ngondo ŵa ku Siliya ŵala kuti amenyane nawo ngondo, nambo Asiliyawo ŵatisile jwalakwe mkanayice pa malopo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.10.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.10.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 10:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Piŵalolite Aamoni kuti Asiliya atisile, nombe nawo ŵatisile mkanayice Abishayi pa malopo, ni ŵajile kwinjila mu msinda. Papopo Yowabu ŵalesile kumenyana ni Aamoni, ni ŵawujile ku Yelusalemu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.10.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.10.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 10:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.10.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.10.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 10:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nambo Asiliya piŵayiweni kuti Aisalaeli apundile pa ngondojo, ŵasongenye asilikali ŵawo ŵa ngondo wosope. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.10.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.10.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 10:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hadadesa mwenye jwawo ŵatumile ŵa mitenga kuti akajigale Asiliya acimjawo ŵiŵaliji pesi Lusulo lwa Yufuleti. Ni ŵayice nawo ku Helamu pamo ni Shobaki, jwakulongolela jwa asilikali ŵa ngondo ŵa Hadadesa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.10.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.10.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 10:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi piŵapikene yeleyi, nombe nawo ŵasongenye asilikali ŵakwe ŵa ngondo wosope ŵa Aisalaeli, ni ŵajombwece Lusulo lwa Yolodani, ni ŵajile kwika ku Helamu. Asiliya ŵala ŵaliŵicile cile kuti alimbane najo Daudi, ni kweli ŵamenyene najo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.10.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.10.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 10:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nambo Panyuma pakwe Asiliyawo ŵatisile, kwatila Aisalaeli. Nambo Daudi ŵawuleje asilikali ŵa ngondo ŵakwela pa yigeleta yakwanila 700, ni asilikali ŵa ngondo ŵakwela pa mahaci ŵakwanila 40,000. Ŵamwulesye Shobaki, jwakulongolela jwa likuga lyawo lya asilikali ŵa ngondo jula, mpaka ŵawilile papopo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.10.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.10.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 10:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Myoyo acayimwene wosope ŵiŵamtumicilaga Hadadesa, piŵaweni kuti apundidwe pa ngondo ni Aisalaeli, ŵapangene nawo Aisalaeli ya mkamulano ŵa mtendele, ni ŵatandite kwatumicila Aisalaeliwo. Asiliya nombe nawo ŵajogwepe kwakamucisya soni Aamoni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.10.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.10.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
